<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-26T23:41:26+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 26 Aug 2026 23:41:26 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Chantelle Van Vliet wins £32,237 after being fired over menopause symptoms, tribunal rules]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133546870.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 48-year-old beauty therapist was fired after requesting flexible working hours to manage severe menopause symptoms, including fatigue, confusion and brain fog. An employment tribunal found that she had been subjected to disability discrimination and denied reasonable workplace support. Chantelle Van Vliet was awarded £32,237 in compensation, although receiving the money remains uncertain because the company is in voluntary liquidation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/beauty-therapist-chantelle-van-vliet-was-fired-after-asking-for-flexible-hours-over-severe-menopause-symptoms-wins-32237-after-tribunal-finds-she-was-denied-reasonable-workplace-support/articleshow/133546870.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/beauty-therapist-chantelle-van-vliet-was-fired-after-asking-for-flexible-hours-over-severe-menopause-symptoms-wins-32237-after-tribunal-finds-she-was-denied-reasonable-workplace-support/articleshow/133546870.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T22:39:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133546974,imgsize-45438.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Alyssa Yu, the 17-year-old Maryland student who built a mathematical model for what...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133545175.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A student from Maryland has developed an innovative model aimed at predicting the interactions of infectious diseases, effectively filling a critical gap in public health forecasting amid multiple outbreaks. Her groundbreaking research has garnered her recognition as a finalist in a national science competition. This mathematical framework could revolutionize the planning of focused vaccination campaigns during epidemics, providing essential strategies for managing disease transmission.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/meet-alyssa-yu-the-17-year-old-maryland-student-who-built-a-mathematical-model-for-what-happens-when-2-interacting-infections-spread-at-once-and-how-vaccination-could-target-the-resulting-hot-spots/articleshow/133545175.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/meet-alyssa-yu-the-17-year-old-maryland-student-who-built-a-mathematical-model-for-what-happens-when-2-interacting-infections-spread-at-once-and-how-vaccination-could-target-the-resulting-hot-spots/articleshow/133545175.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T21:07:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133545287,imgsize-485384.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[ICE arrests nearly 50,000 immigrants in July, highest monthly tally under Trump’s second term]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133548290.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-arrests-nearly-50000-immigrants-in-july-highest-monthly-tally-under-trumps-second-term/articleshow/133548290.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-arrests-nearly-50000-immigrants-in-july-highest-monthly-tally-under-trumps-second-term/articleshow/133548290.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T23:26:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133548290,imgsize-115258.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Kinley Rasmus, the 12-year-old Alabama girl who became only the 25th girl to play in the...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133540180.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kinley Rasmus made history as the 25th girl to participate in the Little League World Series. With a remarkable debut, she pitched six scoreless innings, striking out eight batters, equaling Mo'ne Davis's record for female pitchers. Additionally, Rasmus made her mark by setting a record for the highest number of hits by a female player, earning admiration from fans across the nation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-kinley-rasmus-the-12-year-old-alabama-girl-who-became-only-the-25th-girl-to-play-in-the-little-league-world-series-and-struck-out-six-batters-in-a-win/articleshow/133540180.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-kinley-rasmus-the-12-year-old-alabama-girl-who-became-only-the-25th-girl-to-play-in-the-little-league-world-series-and-struck-out-six-batters-in-a-win/articleshow/133540180.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T19:23:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133543251,imgsize-863651.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Ashka Shah, the 17-year-old New York student who studied how a cancer-driving protein]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133543660.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A student from New York has pioneered a groundbreaking technique aimed at halting the growth of cancer cells. This research focuses on a crucial protein linked to the rapid development of tumors. By inhibiting the harmful activity of this protein, her method preserves the viability of healthy cells. She gained national acclaim as a finalist in a prestigious science competition, illuminating a promising new pathway for precision cancer therapies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-ashka-shah-the-17-year-old-new-york-student-who-studied-how-a-cancer-driving-protein-enters-the-cell-nucleus-and-found-a-way-to-block-its-harmful-signalling-while-preserving-its-normal-function/articleshow/133543660.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-ashka-shah-the-17-year-old-new-york-student-who-studied-how-a-cancer-driving-protein-enters-the-cell-nucleus-and-found-a-way-to-block-its-harmful-signalling-while-preserving-its-normal-function/articleshow/133543660.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T20:54:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133545117,imgsize-606593.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US colleges are rolling out three-year bachelor's degrees in 120 programmes across 26 states]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133540572.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US colleges are increasingly offering three-year bachelor's degree programmes that require 90 credits instead of the traditional 120. The programmes are now available or announced in 26 states, with 119 reduced-credit programmes identified by RAND. Supporters say they can save students time and money, while critics question their impact on learning, professional licensing, graduate admissions and employer acceptance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/american-colleges-are-rolling-out-90-credit-three-year-bachelors-degrees-in-nearly-120-programmes-across-26-states-cutting-a-year-off-college-and-potentially-saving-students-up-to-20000/articleshow/133540572.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/american-colleges-are-rolling-out-90-credit-three-year-bachelors-degrees-in-nearly-120-programmes-across-26-states-cutting-a-year-off-college-and-potentially-saving-students-up-to-20000/articleshow/133540572.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T20:39:41+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133541534,imgsize-118891.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Holly Madison won’t sell her ‘haunted’ LA home; lists it for rent at $9,500 a month]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133541627.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Holly Madison has listed her historic Tudor-style Los Angeles home for $9,500 a month after deciding not to sell it. She bought the property for just under $1.5 million in 2012 and has described it as a fairytale-like home. The house was also investigated for paranormal activity in 2021. Madison says she may eventually keep the property for retirement and pass it on to her children.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/holly-madison-bought-a-los-angeles-fairytale-home-for-under-1-5-million-in-2012-she-now-refuses-to-sell-the-allegedly-haunted-house-and-is-renting-it-for-9500-a-month/articleshow/133541627.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/holly-madison-bought-a-los-angeles-fairytale-home-for-under-1-5-million-in-2012-she-now-refuses-to-sell-the-allegedly-haunted-house-and-is-renting-it-for-9500-a-month/articleshow/133541627.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T20:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133543036,imgsize-149191.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[3 Telangana students killed in Florida road accident, one identified as Nizamabad native]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133542639.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/3-telangana-students-killed-in-florida-road-accident-one-identified-as-nizamabad-native/articleshow/133542639.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/3-telangana-students-killed-in-florida-road-accident-one-identified-as-nizamabad-native/articleshow/133542639.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T19:10:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133542743,imgsize-166747.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Confucius: "The good man does not grieve that other people do not..."]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133543532.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-confucius-the-good-man-does-not-grieve-that-other-people-do-not-recognize-his-merits-his-only-anxiety-is-/articleshow/133543532.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-confucius-the-good-man-does-not-grieve-that-other-people-do-not-recognize-his-merits-his-only-anxiety-is-/articleshow/133543532.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T19:38:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133543624,imgsize-745467.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[3 teenagers killed, 4 injured in Brooklyn highway crash]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133543936.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/3-teenagers-killed-4-injured-in-brooklyn-highway-crash/articleshow/133543936.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/3-teenagers-killed-4-injured-in-brooklyn-highway-crash/articleshow/133543936.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T20:03:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133544082,imgsize-753732.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California man arrested with guillotine in pickup truck near US Capitol building]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133545213.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-man-arrested-with-guillotine-in-pickup-truck-near-us-capitol-building/articleshow/133545213.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-man-arrested-with-guillotine-in-pickup-truck-near-us-capitol-building/articleshow/133545213.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T21:02:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133545232,imgsize-133423.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Singapore is paying parents $55,000 to have babies; here's why]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133538724.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a groundbreaking move, Singapore is launching a substantial financial support package designed for families with children. Targeted at reversing the alarming trend of declining birth rates, the government will provide up to S$70,000 per child until they reach seventeen. This initiative replaces previous schemes, providing consistent financial relief to parents, thereby encouraging family growth in the nation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/singapore-will-pay-about-55000-in-support-for-each-child-why-the-country-is-paying-parents-to-have-babies/articleshow/133538724.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/singapore-will-pay-about-55000-in-support-for-each-child-why-the-country-is-paying-parents-to-have-babies/articleshow/133538724.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T16:41:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133538935,imgsize-1057675.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan puts $6.5 million toward 22,650 Keweenaw acres as conservation fund tops $1.4 billion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133538900.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Michigan’s Natural Resources Trust Fund is marking 50 years of supporting land conservation and outdoor recreation. Created in 1976 using earnings from state-owned oil, gas and mineral revenues, the fund has awarded nearly $1.4 billion so far. Its latest grants include $6.5 million to acquire nearly 22,650 acres in the Keweenaw Peninsula, along with funding for parks, trails, waterfront areas and recreation projects across Michigan.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1976-michigan-created-a-conservation-fund-from-oil-gas-and-mineral-revenues-50-years-later-it-has-awarded-nearly-1-4-billion-and-is-putting-6-5-million-toward-almost-22650-keweenaw-acres/articleshow/133538900.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1976-michigan-created-a-conservation-fund-from-oil-gas-and-mineral-revenues-50-years-later-it-has-awarded-nearly-1-4-billion-and-is-putting-6-5-million-toward-almost-22650-keweenaw-acres/articleshow/133538900.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T18:14:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133539635,imgsize-140737.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A New Zealand sailor spent years living alone on a remote Cook Islands atoll across 3 separate stays]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133539848.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Suwarrow atoll, once the secluded refuge of hermit Tom Neale, has transformed into the Cook Islands' inaugural conservation sanctuary. After Neale spent sixteen years in seclusion on Anchorage Island, the atoll was designated as a national park and bird haven. This vital area now protects critical seabird nesting grounds and marine ecosystems, allowing Neale's legacy to be honored through his preserved hut and a tribute on the island.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-new-zealand-sailor-spent-years-living-alone-on-a-remote-cook-islands-atoll-across-three-separate-stays-a-year-after-his-final-stay-ended-suwarrow-was-declared-a-national-park/articleshow/133539848.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-new-zealand-sailor-spent-years-living-alone-on-a-remote-cook-islands-atoll-across-three-separate-stays-a-year-after-his-final-stay-ended-suwarrow-was-declared-a-national-park/articleshow/133539848.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T17:21:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133540062,imgsize-1119008.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Prince Harry, Meghan and children arrive in UK after 6 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133541066.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/prince-harry-meghan-and-children-arrive-in-uk-after-6-years/articleshow/133541066.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/prince-harry-meghan-and-children-arrive-in-uk-after-6-years/articleshow/133541066.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T18:08:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133541320,imgsize-1160940.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[14 fossilised teeth from Egypt reveal five extinct ancient shark species]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133540213.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Fossilised shark teeth from Egypt's Western Desert reveal prehistoric ocean life. Scientists discovered teeth from five extinct shark species in the Abu-Tartur Plateau region. These ancient predators inhabited warm tropical seas during the Late Cretaceous period. The findings expand the known record of shark diversity in North Africa. This discovery highlights Egypt's ancient marine environments hidden beneath its deserts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/14-fossilised-teeth-found-in-egypts-ancient-shark-graveyard-reveal-five-extinct-species-from-the-age-of-dinosaurs/articleshow/133540213.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/14-fossilised-teeth-found-in-egypts-ancient-shark-graveyard-reveal-five-extinct-species-from-the-age-of-dinosaurs/articleshow/133540213.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T18:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133540618,imgsize-281812.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[This 240-mile stretch on Dalton highway in Alaska is one of America’s remotest roadways]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133540216.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-240-mile-dalton-highway-in-alaska-with-no-petrol-stations-restaurants-or-hotel